      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Investigation of markers of humoral stress was conducted in 25 babies (the main group), in whom a central neuroaxial blocade was performed while doing various surgical interventions. In a control group there were included 20 babies, in whom a standard atharalgesia was applied. The best efficacy was achieved while anesthesia using central neuroaxial blocade."},
